## Deploy workflow

1. Develop in `public_html/`
2. **Doctor:** `scripts/dc-deploy-doctor.sh`
3. **Deploy:** `scripts/dc-deploy.sh --confirm <files>`
4. Cache: `scripts/dc-cf-purge.sh` if public HTML/CSS changed

```bash
scripts/dc-deploy-changed.sh             # git diff → deploy (needs git)
scripts/dc-pull.sh                         # sunucudan çek
```

Shared transport: `scripts/lib/dc-deploy-common.sh` — rsync + SSH key + `mkdir -p` before upload.

## Rules

- `source .cursor/deploy.local.env` before manual SSH/rsync
- `php -l` every changed `.php` before deploy (script does this)
- `COPYFILE_DISABLE=1` on all scp/rsync (macOS)
- Reload `php8.3-fpm` after editing existing PHP (OPcache) — script handles this
- **Agents:** production deploy only when user explicitly requests; always `--confirm`

